# Abandon a colony. Fixture: the Scout #95 at (24,66) is selected (head.active_unit, cursor stuff.x/y) so the
# view shows Port au Prince (27,64), pop 1; France keeps four other colonies, so the prompt is @ABANDON.
click 168 96               # open Port au Prince
wait 10
drag 5 155 131 112         # its only colonist -> fence: role popup
click 100 87               # plain Colonist: leaving would empty the colony, @ABANDON prompt (default "Never!")
click 100 136              # "Yes, it is God's will.": colony removed, the colonist stands on (27,64), back on the map
wait 20
